  "description": "Add-on IFileExtractor for Scrubkit that reads .epub e-books: the Title/Author/Subject become metadata and the book's text (from the XHTML spine, tags stripped) becomes text. Fully offline with no dependencies beyond Scrubkit.Abstractions. Register it via ReadOptions.Extractors.",
